# ISPsystem
IT infrastructure management platforms for hosting providers, data centers, and enterprises.

> Founded in 2004 | 300,000+ servers worldwide | 100+ countries

## Core products
- VMmanager: Virtualization management platform for VPS/VDS hosting and fault-tolerant clusters. Supports 22,000+ VMs, 50+ clusters, 350+ physical servers per installation.
  https://www.ispsystem.com/vmmanager

- DCImanager: Physical IT infrastructure management for dedicated servers and colocation. Multi-vendor support for servers, racks, switches, PDUs, UPSs. Used by 300+ clients with 70,000+ servers.
  https://www.ispsystem.com/dcimanager

- BILLmanager: Billing and service automation for hosting providers, cloud providers, and service delivery.
  https://www.ispsystem.com/billmanager

